Example of VSRC as power ports at 80 C (sp1 derivative, #499)
*
*
V1 in 0 dc 0 ac 1 portnum 1 z0 100 pwr 0.001 freq 2.3e9
*V1 in 0 dc 1 ac 1
Rpt in x 100
C1 x 0 1e-9
*Vx x 0 0
R2  x out 10
V2 out 0 dc 0 ac 0 portnum 2 z0 50 pwr 0.002 freq 3.2e9
*V2 out 0 dc 0 ac 0

.options temp=80
.sp lin 5 1e8 1e9 1


.end
